# MTA build output. `mta.yaml` is the tracked source descriptor; these are
# derived from it by the Cloud MTA Build Tool and are regenerable:
#   npx mbt mtad-gen   -> mtad.yaml (the deployment descriptor)
#   npx mbt build      -> mta_archives/*.mtar
